        <mxCell id="ws" value='&lt;b style="font-size:13px"&gt;workspace&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Component: Rust, workspace/ (mod, page, timeline, facet, chart, export, context, preview, insights, tail/: live tail, alerts, mutes)]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Workspace implements LogStore, in memory. open / reload / clear / remove_source / refresh_files (live tail) / restore (projects); import_files in parallel with rayon, then rebuild (sort by time, number ids, fields, default grouping, cache reset). Queries: matching (cached), page, timeline, facet, chart, source_context, preview_extractor, export. Insights: run_query, check_query, complete_query, patterns, exception_groups, anomalies (cached), compare, field_stats, correlate, traces, requests, moment. Calls WorkspaceHook.on_loaded / on_cleared / on_profile_changed.' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#78A8D8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="660" y="430" width="1420" height="240" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
