        <mxCell id="p_rt" value='&lt;b style="font-size:13px"&gt;plugin runtime&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Component: Rust, plugin/{manifest, graph, runtime, services, watchdog}.rs]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Manifest (semver, requires / optional deps, provides); pure dependency graph (cycles, inactive reasons cascading to dependents); activate in dependency order, deactivate in reverse; guarded Service proxies and extension points; watchdog time budgets (hung).' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#78A8D8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
